Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:08.82,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}把血肉 心灵 尽数吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:12.33,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:20.33,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}再等我一下 一下就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:26.08,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}我如此祈愿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:28.26,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{=25}{\fad(300,300)\be20}只是 只是
